 On May 18, FM Sergey #Lavrov met with Under-Secretary-General, High Representative for
@UNAOC
 @MiguelMoratinos
 in Moscow.

The Sides focused on inter-civilisational dialogue, the persecution of canonical Orthodoxy in Ukraine, & other pressing issues.
