 #Zakharova: On Dec 16, in Washington, 200 believers held meetings with members of Congress to highlight the persecution of the UOC in Ukraine.
@RepLuna
 & 
@EliCrane_CEO
 cited the many #KievRegimeCrimes & challenged continued financial assistance to Zelensky & co.

 #Zakharova: The actions of external forces seeking to aggravate energy crisis in Cuba, including by disrupting air links, are clearly aiming to fuel discontent among locals & foreigners.
@MFA_Russia
 and 
@EmbRusCuba
 remain in close & constant contact with the Cuban authorities

