 5,000+ people attended the performances.

#RussiaHelps

 On March 12, Russia’s EMERCOM (
@MchsRussia
) delivered 13K+ tonnes of medical supplies to Azerbaijan with a further transfer to the recipients –  the people of Iran.

 On March 18, FM Sergey #Lavrov & Head of the Federal Department of Foreign Affairs of Switzerland 
@ignaziocassis
 exchanged congratulatory messages on the occasion of the 80th anniversary of the restoration of diplomatic relations between the two countries.

 #Zakharova: The rapid expansion of international contacts by St Petersburg & the Leningrad Region is clear evidence that the regions are:

• steadily diversifying their external economic ties;
• opening new niches;
• deepening cooperation with traditional partners.

 On March 13, the Russian Foreign Ministry summoned ambassadors 
@NigelCaseyHMA
 & 
@NDeRiviere
 & issued a strong protest over the March 10 inhumane strike on Bryansk by Ukrainian militants using cruise missiles produced by the Franco-British company MBDA.
t.me/MFARussia/28686

 FM Sergey #Lavrov's schedule:

Dec 8  – Interagency Commission on Caspian Cooperation;

Dec 10  – Address at the Federation Council of Russia;

Dec 11 – Ambassadorial roundtable at 
@DipacademyMID
 on “The Ukrainian Crisis: Diplomacy and Prospects for Settlement”.

 President Vladimir #Putin is holding a meeting with US Special Envoy Steven #Witkoff

Presidential Aide Yuri #Ushakov and Special Presidential Representative 
@kadmitriev
 are attending the meeting on the Russian Side. 

The US is represented by 
@SteveWitkoff
 & 
@jaredkushner
.

 On April 23, on the sidelines of the #BRICS consultations of high representatives on the Middle East & North Africa, DFM Georgy #Borisenko met with Dr Neena Malhotra, Secretary (South) & 
@ranganathan_sr
, Secretary (CPV & OIA), 
@IndianDiplomacy
.
t.me/MFARussia/29469

 Russia's Foreign Minister Sergey #Lavrov’s opening remarks during talks with UN Secretary-General 
@mbachelet
:


@UN
 Secretary-General must be neutral, independent, and committed to the entirety of the UN Charter – not to double standards.
t.me/MFARussia/30342

 #Zakharova: In November 2025, Russian citizen Anna Novikova was detained in France on a far-fetched pretext.

This is yet another example of the Russophobic spy mania that has gripped France.


@mfa_russia
 & 
@AmbRusFrance
 will do everything possible to secure Anna's release.

 Chargé d’Affaires of the UK in Russia 
@danaedholakia
 was summoned to 
@mfa_russia
.

 #Zakharova: We took note of a call by 
@volker_turk
 & 
@UNHumanRights
 on the international community “to take immediate steps to eliminate the impact of sanctions on the rights of the Iranian people".

We hope that countries around the world will heed this call.

 #Zakharova: According to our estimates, some 50K Russian tourists are currently in the Middle East & have been affected by the conflict around Iran.
@mfa_russia
 & other agencies are closely monitoring the situation & assisting with the organisation of evacuation flights.

 In Beijing, Presidents #Putin & Xi Jinping viewed a photo exhibition prepared by the 
@tass_agency
 & 
@XHNews
.

 It follows the development of #RussiaChina relations & titled "Unbreakable Friendship Between Great Peoples, Strategic Partnership Between Great Powers".

