 #Zakharova: German law enforcement agencies have detained a Russian citizen Suren #Avdzhyan on charges of supplying humanitarian aid to Donbass.


@mfa_russia
 has demanded that Germany grant immediate consular access to the detained Russian citizen.

FM Sergey #Lavrov's schedule:

• On April 3, a meeting with #SCO Secretary-General Nurlan Yermekbayev;

• On April 7, a meeting with 
@UNCTAD
 Secretary-General 
@RGrynspan
;

• On April 8, 46th Meeting of the 
@mfa_russia
 Council of the Heads of Constituent Entities of Russia.

 #Zakharova: On January 6, UK Prime Minister 
@Keir_Starmer
, French President 
@EmmanuelMacron
, and Zelensky signed a declaration of intent to deploy multinational force to Ukraine.

If this plan is implemented, responsibility for lives of British citizens will rest with London.

 #Zakharova: We have repeatedly drawn attention to the threat of Russian citizens being detained & arrested in third countries at the request of the US.


@mfa_russia
 has issued a travel advisory on the risks posed by states that have extradition treaties with the US.

 Russia's Federal Assembly 
@sovfedinfo
:

Russian Senators are deeply alarmed by the intention of the UK & France to supply Ukraine with nuclear weapons.

We call on our colleagues – 
@HouseofCommons
 & 
@UKHouseofLords
, 
@AssembleeNat
 & 
@Senat
 – to immediately look into this issue.

 #Zakharova: On February 12 the first conference of the International Young Diplomats’ Association to be held at 
@mgimo_en
The association is a unique discussion platform which includes over 250 young diplomats from 61 countries.

  On June 4, President of Tanzania 
@SuluhuSamia
 visited 
@UniversityRudn
, where she received the regalia of Honorary Doctor.

In just five years, the number of African students has doubled – with 2,600+ students from 52 African countries now studying at #RUDN.

 #Zakharova:

A wave of publications in French media outlets (
@jeune_afrique
, 
@TV5MONDE
, 
@RFI
) is deliberately misrepresenting Russia’s role in fighting terrorism in the Sahel.

 The goal is clear – to devalue Russia’s contribution to regional security.

 On April 16, Ambassador of Mexico to Russia 
@evillegasme
 was summoned to 
@mfa_russia
 over concerns about the Mexican authorities’ failure to act regarding the unlawful detention of a minor Russian citizen, Christina Romanova, at a closed institution.
t.me/MFARussia/29305

 #Zakharova: On April 16, Ambassador of Mexico, 
@evillegasme
, was summoned to 
@mfa_russia
Serious concern was expressed over Mexican authorities' failure to resolve the situation involving Russian citizen Kristina Romanova, unlawfully held by Mexico’s child protection services

#RussiaHelps

 #Zakharova: At President Vladimir Putin’s command, a Russian EMERCOM special airlift delivered 35 tonnes of aid to Sri Lanka on Dec.10, organised by 
@MFA_Russia
 and 
@RusEmbSriLanka
 @HMVijithaHerath
 highlighted the gesture as a sign of friendly relations

 #Zakharova: 
@UN
 Secretary-General 
@antonioguterres
 went as far as to claim that in Ukraine’s case territorial integrity prevails over the right to self-determination.

 The Secretary-General has no mandate to interpret the UN Charter’s principles on behalf of the UN.

 On March 20, DFM Georgy #Borisenko received Ambassador of Israel to Moscow 
@OdedJoseph
. 

The Russian side issued a protest in connection with the shelling of an 
@RT_com
 film crew, whose members were injured as a result of an Israeli Air Force missile strike in Lebanon.

